?","nextNodeIds":[240070503]},{"nodeId":240070503,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5021,"speakerName":"Lovi","textMapHash":3439150394,"text":"I'm trying to make my own clockwork puppet. Actually, I've been secretly looking into knowledge related to that.","nextNodeIds":[240070504]},{"nodeId":240070504,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5021,"speakerName":"Lovi","textMapHash":2814946586,"text":"Once I figure it all out, I'm going to make a huge Clockwork Meka — now that'll stun Daddy!","nextNodeIds":[240070505]},{"nodeId":240070505,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5021,"speakerName":"Lovi","textMapHash":195313826,"text":"I've read lots of books in his room, and I've made some basic components according to the instructions therein.","nextNodeIds":[240070506]},{"nodeId":240070506,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5021,"speakerName":"Lovi","textMapHash":3049143106,"text":"I'm pretty sure that mek's within reach so long as I keep working at it!","nextNodeIds":[240070507]},{"nodeId":240070507,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5021,"speakerName":"Lovi","textMapHash":2180045082,"text":"But I can't study these things in the city, or he'll find out — and that would ruin the surprise.","nextNodeIds":[240070508]},{"nodeId":240070508,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5062,"speakerName":"Verut","textMapHash":176115938,"text":"That's how this place became Lovi's secret clockwork research base. As for me... Well, I'm her assistant.","nextNodeIds":[240070509]},{"nodeId":240070509,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5021,"speakerName":"Lovi","textMapHash":560474178,"text":"Well, assistant, talk is cheap! Let's start our research. Today, we must make a moving mechanical arm!","nextNodeIds":[240070510]},{"nodeId":240070510,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5062,"speakerName":"Verut","textMapHash":289832906,"text":"Aye aye, ma'am! Let our research begin!","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2400705,0],"P